 ],
 "balloons": [
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "We are small. If even two of them agreed to split us, we would last a season.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Perhaps two.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Do you know why I have spent twenty years taking every small kingdom on this coast?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "To deny them footholds.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-04",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Partly. A hundred small kingdoms are a hundred small throats to cut.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "One larger kingdom is a single throat, yes, but it is also a single fist.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-02-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I do not take these lands because I am greedy. Divided, we are meat. United, we are at least a problem.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "Kottarakkara.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Yes. Kottarakkara. The last of the old houses that still believes it can stand alone.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "ramayyan",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "LANNOY"
   ],
   "text": "This is not war. This is siege without walls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-03-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "Walls can be rebuilt. What we are breaking cannot.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "eustachius",
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "If I give her the throne of Kottarakkara, every house I have absorbed will see it as permission to demand the same.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "They will point to Savitri and say, see, the old ways still hold.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And if you refuse?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Then I make an enemy of a woman with legitimate grievances and powerful friends. The Dutch will use her. And Velinadu...",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Did you know it would be her?",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "I knew it would be someone like her. Sharp. Legitimate. Connected.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-04-panel-05",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "RAMAYYAN"
   ],
   "text": "The worst kind of enemy: one who is not wrong.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "ramayyan"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "The Maratha rider. Marthanda Varma's foreign sword.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "I am not here to fight you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "No. You are here to measure me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "To see if I am the kind of threat that can be bought, or frightened, or simply waited out.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "And which are you?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "I am the kind that remembers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "My kinsman died in a room he could not leave, asking for air, asking for home.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-05-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king calls that statecraft. I call it murder dressed in manners.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "He threatened Travancore's unity. He invited our enemies into his court.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "He defended his house. As his mothers did before him. As I will.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Do you know why your king fears the matrilineal law?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Not because it is old. Because it gives women like me standing.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "A claim that does not depend on which man thinks he owns me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Your king builds a state where power flows downward from one throne.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "We come from a world where it flows sideways. Through sisters, through daughters, through the women who remember.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "That world is ending.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Perhaps. Or perhaps it will outlast his walls.",
   "tail": "tail to the panel edge (off-panel speaker)",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-06-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Empires fall. Women remain.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Tell him I will not disappear quietly. Tell him the Dutch have already made offers.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "NAGOJI"
   ],
   "text": "You would sell your coast to the very powers you claim to oppose?",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "I would survive. We outlast the men who think they own us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-07-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "We tend our gardens long after their forts have fallen.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You could have run.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "nagoji",
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "This is my land. I will not watch it from a ship.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I met you once. When we were young. Before any of this.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You had a laugh that carried across courtyards.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "I have not laughed in a long time.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-08-panel-05",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "No. Neither have I.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "I will not kill you. I will not imprison you.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-01",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "You will go to Kochi, to the Dutch who promised you so much and delivered so little.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "If you set foot in Travancore again, I will treat you as I would any invader.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "Exile.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-02",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA (off)"
   ],
   "text": "Survival. More than your kinsman received.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "You are building something. I see it.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "But every house you broke, every succession you denied, every woman you sent into exile, we become stories. And stories outlast walls.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-03",
   "balloon": 3,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "They will remember me.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 1,
   "speakers": [
    "VARMA"
   ],
   "text": "Let them. I build for the living, not the remembered.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  },
  {
   "panel": "page-09-panel-04",
   "balloon": 2,
   "speakers": [
    "SAVITRI"
   ],
   "text": "That is why you will never understand us.",
   "tail": "tail ringed",
   "cast": [
    "savitri",
    "varma"
   ]
  }
 ]
}